{
  "title": "Make meal-plan recipe choices keyboard accessible",
  "description": "MealPlanPage.tsx renders each .recipe-picker-item as a div with an onClick handler inside the Add Recipe modal. \
The rows cannot be reached with Tab or activated with Enter/Space, so a keyboard user can search for recipes but cannot select a result. \
Use semantic interactive controls and add browser coverage for searching, tabbing to a result, and adding it. \
Assess the corresponding iOS recipe picker and cover its accessible result actions too. \
This is separate from shared modal focus containment, which cannot make non-interactive result rows keyboard-operable.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "task",
